"A local gas station is selling gas for $3.00 a gallon. An app company is offering $.20 cashback per gallon if you fill up at this station. If someone buys 10 gallons of gas, how much will their gas cost, after the cashback rewards, considering the discount?","A local gas station is selling gas for $3.00 a gallon. An app company is offering $.20 cashback per gallon if you fill up at this station. If someone buys 10 gallons of gas, how much with their gas be, after the cashback rewards?",28,28,28.00,28.00,"To solve this problem step by step:

