Violetta wants new crayons in 5 different colors and prepared $20. One crayon costs $2. How much change will she get?,Violetta wants to buy new crayons. She needs them in 5 different colors and prepared $20 for this purchase. One crayon costs $2. How much change will she get?,10,10,10,10,"Step 1: Determine how many crayons Violetta wants.
