"In a large urban area, 200 pounds of carrots are to be distributed to 40 restaurants. Each restaurant is to receive 2 pounds of carrots. How many pounds of carrots will not be used?",200 pounds of carrots are to be distributed to 40 restaurants in a certain city. Each restaurant is to receive 2 pounds of carrots. How many pounds of carrots will not be used?,120,120,120,120,"To solve the problem step by step:

