"Sarah has 9 books and Joseph originally had twice the number of Sarah’s books. Unfortunately, he lost 2 of them recently. How many books does Joseph currently have?","Sarah has 9 books and Joseph had twice the number of Sarah’s books, but he lost 2 of them. How many books does Joseph currently have?",16,16,16,16,"Step 1: Determine how many books Joseph originally had.  
