"Jeff is 10 years older than his younger sister, Martha. Martha, on the other hand, is 4 years younger than her boyfriend, Mike, who enjoys playing basketball. If Mike is 24 years old, how old is Jeff?","Jeff is 10 years older than his younger sister, Martha. Martha, on the other hand, is 4 years younger than her boyfriend, Mike. If Mike is 24 years old, how old is Jeff?",30,30,30,30,"To solve the problem step by step:

