3 trees each had 7 blue birds. 2 different trees each had 4 blue birds. 1 final tree had 3 blue birds. How many blue birds were in the trees in total?,3 trees each had 7 blue birds in them. 2 different trees each had 4 blue birds. 1 final tree had 3 blue birds. How many blue birds were in the trees in total?,32,32,32,32,"To solve the problem step by step:

